\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{\PYGZdq{}Here he is—wig, whiskers, eyebrows, and all. I thought my disguise was pretty good, }
\PYG{+w}{      }\PYG{n+no}{but I hardly expected that it would stand that test.\PYGZdq{}}

